===Verb===
{{en-verb|timetabl|ing}}

# {{transitive}} To arrange a specific time for (an event, a class, etc).
#: ''I've '''timetabled''' the meeting for Monday afternoon.''

====Synonyms====
* (''insert (an event, etc) into a timetable''): [[schedule]]

====Derived terms====
